> Here's the Stan function for the generalized inverse Gaussian
> functions {
>   real generalized_inverse_gaussian_lpdf(real x, int p, real a, real b) {
>       real lp =
>       p * 0.5 * log(a / b)
>       - log(2 * modified_bessel_second_kind(p, sqrt(a * b)))
